# skuggi — Cursor Instructions

All rules and commands live in [`.ai/`](../../.ai/) — the single source of truth. This file mirrors [`CLAUDE.md`](../../CLAUDE.md); keep them in sync.

skuggi is a locally-hosted LangGraph **pentesting agent harness** (Python ≥3.12,
uv, `src/` layout): a planner→worker→critic loop with a headless `AgentCore` and
two front-ends. Source is grouped into eight packages under `src/skuggi/`
(`agent`, `frontend`, `config`, `engagement`, `persistence`, `providers`,
`tooling`, `common`, `install`).

