## Critical rules (excerpt)

- **`make check` before done** (ruff format --check · ruff · mypy strict · pytest 90% branch); fix at the root, don't widen an ignore.
- **A green gate is not proof of isolation** — tests redirect `SKUGGI_CONFIG_HOME`/`SKUGGI_DATA_HOME`; verify the real homes are unchanged after a run.
- **Never automate the harness against real homes or a live engagement.**
- **Never resolve a storage path at import time**; keep the lazy imports lazy.
- **Prompts live in `agent/prompts.py`; the verb set in `frontend/verbs.py`.**
